{
  "title": "White-water kayaking",
  "folderName": "White-water_kayaking",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-16T14:46:28.002Z",
  "chunkCount": 69,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "White-water kayaking",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": true
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Have you ever wondered",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "what it's like",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "to travel in a kayak",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "along a fast river,",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "over rocks",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "and even down waterfalls?",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "That's what",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "white-water kayaking is all about!",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "It's a fast, fun",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "and challenging sport!",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "When water flows fast",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "over rocks in the riverbed,",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "or it drops steeply",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "(like over a waterfall),",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "air bubbles are formed",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "and they make the water",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "look white.",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "White-water kayaks",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "are specially designed",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "to move through white water",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "and to turn easily.",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Trip Jennings is",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "a National Geographic Adventurer",
      "pauseSeconds": 7,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "and an extreme white-water kayaker",
      "pauseSeconds": 7,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "who made a journey",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "down the Pandi River",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "in Papua New Guinea.",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "He wanted to make a film",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "to show people",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "what a beautiful place it was.",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Jennings and his team",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "of kayakers started underground,",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "in a cave",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "and then continued down waterfalls,",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "some small and some big,",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "until they arrived",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "at a very steep drop.",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "The photographer had",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "a frightening experience",
      "pauseSeconds": 7,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "when he got trapped",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "behind the waterfall.",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Luckily, Trip threw him a rope",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "and he was able",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "to free himself.",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "White-water kayaking",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "is an exciting sport,",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "but it can also",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "be dangerous.",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "You have to concentrate",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "and think quickly.",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "It's amazing",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "how fast water can flow!",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Tips for white-water kayaking:",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Wear a wetsuit",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "to keep yourself warm.",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Wear a helmet",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "to keep yourself safe.",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Prepare yourself –",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "you should learn",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "how to paddle",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "and how to roll over",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "in the kayak",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "without falling into the water.",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Practise somewhere easy",
      "pauseSeconds": 6,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "before you try kayaking",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "on fast-flowing water.",
      "pauseSeconds": 5,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Relax and go",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "with the flow!",
      "pauseSeconds": 4,
      "isTitle": false
    }
  ],
